Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Posterior Extraction of Phenological Metrics
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Swantje Grabener
Description: Extracts uncertainty-aware phenological metrics (centroids, peaks, duration, modality, divergence) from mgcv GAM/BAM objects using Bayesian posterior simulation.
